---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base
  title="The Bridge Course | Providence Community Church (Lenexa, KS)"
  description="The Bridge Course is a way to explore the Christian faith in a relaxed, non-threatening environment over ten weeks."
  path="/bridge/"
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap" style="max-width:820px;">
      <p class="eyebrow">The Bridge Course</p>
      <h1>We all have questions.</h1>
      <p style="font-size:1.15rem;">The Bridge Course is a way to explore the Christian faith in a relaxed, non-threatening environment over ten weeks.</p>
      <a class="btn" href="/contact/" style="margin-top:12px;">Register for the course</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-rule section-panel">
    <div class="wrap" style="max-width:820px;">
      <h2>Conversations about the big questions of life.</h2>
      <p>Why does God allow suffering? Is Jesus the only way? Is Christianity really worth it? Each week there is a 30-minute talk designed to raise important questions and inspire conversation. After this, there's a 30-minute discussion to interact with the talk and share your perspective.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-rule">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="eyebrow">Here's how it works</p>
      <h2>A simple evening, every week.</h2>
      <div class="grid-3" style="margin-top:36px;">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">First up</p>
          <h3>Food</h3>
          <p style="font-size:0.95rem;">Food has a way of bringing us together and creating good conversation. We start with food so we can get to know each other!</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">Next</p>
          <h3>Talk</h3>
          <p style="font-size:0.95rem;">Talks are designed to raise important questions and inspire conversation. Generally thirty minutes long, they seek to answer important questions.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">Followed by</p>
          <h3>Conversation</h3>
          <p style="font-size:0.95rem;">The discussion is the most important part of Bridge. It's a chance to interact with the talk and share your perspective in a safe environment. You can ask whatever question you like or not say a word.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-rule section-panel">
    <div class="wrap" style="max-width:720px; text-align:center;">
      <h2>Register for Bridge.</h2>
      <p>We'd love to see you at Bridge. The course runs ten consecutive weeks. Reach out and we'll get you the details for the next one.</p>
      <a class="btn" href="/contact/">Get in touch</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
